  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then the ratio of the area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> to the area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> is"
